schema: '0.4'
id: tobor-avatar-orbit
type: image
quality: medium
service: gemini
model: gemini-3.1-flash-image
prompt:
  text: |
    Create a professional UI mascot sprite sheet, exactly FOUR equal columns and TWO equal rows.
    Eight square cells in a strict regular grid, NO gutters, NO borders, NO captions, NO text.
    Uniform solid very dark navy #101827 background across every cell. Render the SAME character
    consistently in every cell. Each character centered in its cell, same scale, completely contained
    with generous 15 percent padding so the cells can be cropped separately. Clean soft 3D toy render,
    subtle ambient lighting, polished ceramic and rubber materials, high legibility at 80 pixel size.
    ORBIT: a friendly cream ceramic spherical robot with a dark rounded visor, two bright teal circular eyes, small orange antenna, stubby floating mitten hands.
    Top row, left to right: (1) IDLE: relaxed neutral happy eyes, hands down;
    (2) LISTENING: attentively leaning with one hand cupped to ear and cyan sound arcs;
    (3) THINKING: one hand to chin, thoughtful tilted gaze, three small glowing dots overhead;
    (4) SPEAKING: expressive open mouth, one hand gesturing, small cyan speech wave near mouth.
    Bottom row, left to right: (5) WORKING: actively holding small glowing orange wrench and gear;
    (6) ERROR: apologetic worried eyes, small red warning triangle beside head;
    (7) OFFLINE: eyes closed as two dim horizontal lines, slumped sleeping pose;
    (8) CELEBRATING: delighted eyes, both hands raised with a few tiny confetti sparkles.
    Every cell contains only the described one character and its little state props. No writing anywhere.
  negative: captions, labels, letters, watermark, grid lines, inconsistent character, cropped limbs
output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 2048
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: '2:1'
eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.75
  criteria:
    sprite_layout:
      weight: 3
      description: Exactly four columns and two rows of eight centered isolated equal-scale figures.
      fail_signals: [cropped character, irregular grid, missing cell]
    character_consistency:
      weight: 3
      description: Same distinctive robot in all cells with clearly distinct requested expressions.
      fail_signals: [different robot, indistinguishable states, unreadable small silhouette]
  reject_if: [text or watermarks, malformed extra limbs]
